itive début in 1928"] " (they had previously done exhibitions). The men contested nine events, with an " [:a {:href "/results/70062"} "individual"] " and " [:a {:href "/results/70063"} "team all-around"] ", and seven apparatus events, including " [:a {:href "/results/70073"} "rope climbing"] ", one of the five times that event would be contested at the Olympics. This was the first Olympics since " [:a {:href "/editions/3/sports/GAR"} "1904"] " (and " [:a {:href "/editions/4/sports/GAR"} "1906"] ") that individual apparatus events were contested as separate medal events."] "\n\n" [:p {} "As would be true through " [:a {:href "/editions/11/sports/GAR"} "1936"] ", Olympic gymnastics in 1924 was contested outdoors, at the " [:a {:href "/venues/265"} "Stade Olympique de Colombes"] ", the main Olympic Stadium. No nation dominated the competitions in 1924, with Yugoslavia (led by " [:a {:href "/athletes/31521"} "Leon Štukelj"] "), Italy, and Switzerland each winning two events, although Czechoslovakian gymnasts won the most medals, with nine, followed by Switzerland, with seven, and France, with six."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70062"} "Individual All-Around, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "17 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "72"] "\n" [:td {} "9"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70063"} "Team All-Around, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "17 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "72"] "\n" [:td {} "9"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70067"} "Horse Vault, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "17 – 20 July 1924"] "\n" [:td {} "70"] "\n" [:td {} "9"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/70068"} "Parallel Bars, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olymp